  "businessLogic": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "step": 1,
        "title": "初始化參數",
        "details": "1.custId從框架獲取\n2.定義currencyList 儲存取得的結果"
      },
      {
        "step": 2,
        "title": "處理邏輯",
        "details": "1. 依 CustId 先查 Redis 常用幣別快取。\n2. Redis 命中時，直接解析 currencyList 回傳。\n3. Redis 未命中時，執行 SELECT @CustId AS custId, @CurrencyList AS currencyList FROM CommonCurrencyList WHERE custId=@custId。\n4. 查詢結果 count > 0 時，解析 DaWho.dbo.CommonCurrencyList.CurrencyList.CURRENAME 為 responseData.currencyList[].currencyCode，並回寫 Redis 常用幣別快取。\n5. 查無資料時回傳未查詢到數據情境，呼叫端依功能 PRD 預設順序處理。"
      },
      {
        "step": 3,
        "title": "回傳執行結果",
        "details": "3.回傳執行結果"
      },
      {
        "step": 4,
        "title": "備註",
        "details": "凍版命名註記：本 sheet 屬業務/共用業務接口，對外 request/response 幣別欄位統一使用 currencyCode/currencyName；來源資料或 DB 欄位仍可標示 CURRENAME/CURRCNAME。"
      }
    ],
